<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged up to 1.8575 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged up to 1.8575 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8575 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8685 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    February 14	   February 13</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8575		  1.8685</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $8.72 million	     $16.90 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
